# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local-only files — kept out of the repo by location.
# Keep every comment on its OWN line; an inline comment silently
# breaks the ignore pattern it shares a line with.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Project-private working notes (local to each developer)
rules_project.md
rules_project-history.md
STATE.md
STATE-history.md
core_principles.md
# The bug tracker is private in EVERY repo, public or not.
# Ignored BEFORE the files were created, never retrofitted.
docs/bugs.json
docs/bugs-history.json

# The workshop — benches, its server config and its launcher — is never in a public
# repo (rules.md §16.6). It is an internal tool and it reads the private layer: the
# tracker bench renders the gitignored tracker. A repo that is private FOREVER may
# track one; "private until release" may not.
# ⭐ ONE DIRECTORY, ONE LINE, AND THE WALL IS GEOGRAPHY RATHER THAN A ROSTER. Everything
# the workshop is lives in here, so git cannot reach any of it and nothing has to be
# remembered when a bench is added. It was three scattered paths until 2026-09-26, and
# the one that sat outside reached the public repo and survived two history scrubs.
/workshop/
# User data — calendar templates, events, notes
/data/
# Local tooling / editor config
.claude/
# Commit-message scratch file
.bobcommit

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copyrighted / per-user content — never commit
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Hymnal lyrics data (copyrighted material)
hymnal-json/
# Scripture cache (user-fetched Bible text)
scripture-cache/
# Source hymnal files (large binary)
*.ppt
*.pptx
# Uploaded theme images
backend/uploads/
# Generated bulletins/slides
output/
# App settings (per-user)
settings.json

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build / dependency artifacts (regenerable)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.spec
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.vite/
*.exe
# Runtime logs from the dev-server manager (may contain local paths)
*.log

